Data: California Department of Fish and Wildlife
------------------------------------------------

The fish planting schedule comes from the California Department of Fish and
Wildlife (CDFW), Fish Planting Schedule:
https://nrm.dfg.ca.gov/FishPlants/PublicPlantSearch

It is used under CDFW's Conditions of Use,
https://wildlife.ca.gov/Conditions-of-Use. This repository uses no CDFW
seals, logos or marks, which those terms reserve.

The Elastic License 2.0 applies to the software. It does not change the
terms of CDFW's data. These files contain CDFW data, or data derived from it:

- pipeline/data/history.json and pipeline/data/aliases.json
- ios/CAFishPlanting/Resources/snapshot.json
- pipeline/tests/fixtures/*.html, pages captured from CDFW's site and kept
  as test fixtures
- the snapshot and website the pipeline builds from them

Every page the website and the app show carries this attribution. Keep it
if you reuse the data:

    Data: California Department of Fish and Wildlife, Fish Planting Schedule
    (https://nrm.dfg.ca.gov/FishPlants/PublicPlantSearch). Schedule is
    subject to change; treat all plants as scheduled, not confirmed.

Trout Truck is independent. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
California Department of Fish and Wildlife.

The terms, quoted verbatim, and the reasoning behind the attribution are in
docs/LICENSES-AND-ATTRIBUTION.md.


